1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:04,319
Hey y'all and welcome to my channel my name is amy darling.
嘿，欢迎来到我的频道，我是 Amy，字幕姓氏 Darling 与频道名 Darley 不一致，待核。

2
00:00:04,319 --> 00:00:08,430
And today's video is going to be my 6 00 a m morning routine.
今天的视频要分享我早晨六点开始的日常。

3
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:16,359
This is going to be on a normal school day where both of my kids are in school from about 8 00 a m until about 2 45 p m.
这是普通上学日，两个孩子大约早上八点到下午两点四十五都在学校。

4
00:00:16,359 --> 00:00:24,640
So I'm going to show you what my morning routine looks like as a stay at home mom of two school ag kids.
所以我要展示作为两个学龄孩子的全职妈妈，我的早晨是什么样；school ag 为字幕识别形式。

5
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:28,599
So on a normal school day my mornings start at 6 00 a m.
普通上学日，我早晨六点起床。

6
00:00:28,599 --> 00:00:34,960
I head straight into the bathroom brush my teeth put my contacts in and throw on a sweatshirt and sweatpants.
我直接去浴室，刷牙、戴隐形眼镜，再穿上卫衣和运动裤。

7
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:40,480
Then I head into the kitchen and get myself a big glass of water.
然后去厨房，给自己倒一大杯水。

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:46,030
And then do an ice roller for a few seconds on my face just to try to wake up.
再用冰滚轮在脸上滚几秒钟，让自己清醒一下。

9
00:01:05,199 --> 00:01:08,680
Now the morning that I was filming this routine was a friday morning.
拍这段日常的那天是星期五早晨。

10
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:12,000
And on fridays we like to do fun friday breakfast.
星期五，我们喜欢来点有趣的特别早餐。

11
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:19,439
So we typically do something like cinnamon rolls or donuts or fun pancakes whatever we decide on for that week.
通常是肉桂卷、甜甜圈或特别的煎饼，就看那周决定做什么。

12
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:26,010
So today I just making cinnamon rolls and I'm going to go ahead and get those popped into the oven.
今天我在做肉桂卷，接下来就把它们送进烤箱。

13
00:01:32,119 --> 00:01:35,240
Next I'm going to go ahead and pack the kids snacks for the day.
接着我要给孩子们装好当天的零食。

14
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:38,960
And if they're eating home lunch I would pack that during this time too.
如果他们带家里的午饭，我也会在这时候装好。

15
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:42,960
But my kids have been loving the school lunches this year at their new school.
不过今年他们特别喜欢新学校的午餐。

16
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:45,520
And rarely ever want packed lunch.
几乎从来不想带饭。

17
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:48,590
So for the kids snack I'm just packing them this little trail mix.
所以零食我给他们装一点混合坚果果干。

18
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:52,360
I actually shared this recipe in my last video so go check it out.
上一期视频分享过做法，大家可以去看看。

19
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:55,000
Which I feel like you can't really mess up a trail mix.
我觉得这种混合零食其实不太容易做砸。

20
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,119
As long as the kids like everything that's in the mix then they're going to love your trail mix.
只要里面全是孩子喜欢的东西，他们就会喜欢这个混合零食。

21
00:01:59,119 --> 00:02:01,640
So I made a huge batch of this trail mix.
所以我一次做了一大批。

22
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:05,640
Which makes it super easy to just pack their snacks for the mornings.
这样早上给他们装零食就非常方便。

23
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:10,679
Now sometimes my kids will actually pack their own snacks the night before if we remember.
有时如果记得，孩子们也会在前一天晚上自己装好零食。

24
00:02:10,679 --> 00:02:17,400
But our evenings are usually pretty crazy and we typically forget to go ahead and pack snacks the night before.
但晚上通常很忙乱，我们常常忘记提前装。

25
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:20,879
At 6 30 a m it is time for the kids to wake up.
早上六点半，孩子们该起床了。

26
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:26,120
I have an 11 year old son named k and a 99 year old daughter gracie june.
我有个十一岁儿子，名字字幕为 K，还有女儿 Gracie June；女儿年龄被识别为99，显然需听辨复核。

27
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:29,680
My son actually wakes up to his alarm at 6 30 a m.
儿子会在六点半闹钟响时自己起床。

28
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:36,160
And he gets himself dressed brushes his teeth and puts his contacts in before he comes downstairs.
他先穿衣、刷牙、戴隐形眼镜，然后才下楼。

29
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:39,720
And we always tell him that if he doesn't get up when his alarm goes off.
我们总告诉他，如果闹钟响了他还不起床……

30
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:42,599
Then he has to wake up 30 minutes earlier the next day.
第二天就必须再提早三十分钟起床。

31
00:02:42,599 --> 00:02:46,440
So that has only happened once this school year.
这学年只发生过一次这种情况。

32
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:49,360
And then I actually go and wake my daughter up.
然后我会去叫醒女儿。

33
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:52,560
She gets herself dressed and brushes her teeth.
她自己穿衣、刷牙。

34
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:56,200
And then next they will eat breakfast I'll do my daughter's hair.
接下来他们吃早餐，我给女儿整理头发。

35
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:59,480
And then we will make sure to have everything packed in their backpacks.
然后确认东西都装进他们的书包。

36
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:04,080
And have head out the door for school no later than 7 15 a m.
最晚早上七点十五分就要出门上学；字幕 have head out 识别不自然，待核。

37
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:07,480
Also my husband has a different work schedule dayto day.
另外，我丈夫每天的工作时间表都不同。

38
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:12,280
So sometimes he's there helping out in the mornings and some days he's gone before we even wake up.
所以有时他早上会帮忙，有时我们还没醒他就走了。

39
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:16,120
But as you could see he was there helping in the background this morning.
不过这天早上，大家能看到他在后面帮忙。

40
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:20,440
And then some days if he's headed into town and his schedule works out.
有些日子，如果他要进城，而且时间安排合适……

41
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:25,920
Then he will actually take the kids to school as well.
他也会送孩子去学校。

42
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:29,959
Our drive to school is about 25 to 30 minutes depending on traffic.
开车去学校大约二十五到三十分钟，取决于路况。

43
00:03:29,959 --> 00:03:34,640
So I usually get back home between 8 15 and 8 30.
所以我一般八点十五到八点半之间到家。

44
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:37,360
And then the first thing I do is make my bed.
回家第一件事就是铺床。

45
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:41,080
And if I'm working out that morning then I'll throw on some workout clothes.
如果那天早晨运动，我就换上运动服。

46
00:04:07,879 --> 00:04:11,360
On this morning I was going for a walk and so I got dressed.
那天早上我要去散步，就先换好了衣服。

47
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:17,000
And it was a little bit chilly outside so I did put on a lightweight poolover as well.
外面有点凉，所以我还穿了件轻薄套头衫；poolover 为字幕识别形式，待核。
